    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, Musa phamwenga na atumia a Iziraeli aambira atu hivi, “Gbwirani amuri zosi ninazokuphani rero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.8.30+JOS.8.31+JOS.8.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joshuwa 8:30–32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku iyo mndiphovuka muho Joridani na kuinjira tsi ambayo Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, anakuphani, mundaika mawe makulu na kugapiga palasta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dzuluye mundaandika maneno gosi ga shariya hino, mndiphoinjira kpwenye tsi hira tsi yenye rutuba, ambayo Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa akare enu, wakulagani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiphokala mkavuka muho Joridani, mundaika mawe higo dzulu ya mwango Ebali na mgapige palasta kama ninavyokuamuruni hivi rero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 20:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundamdzengera Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, phatu pha kulavira sadaka kuhumira mawe ambago tagayatsongbwa na chifwaya cha chuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mdzengereni Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, phatu pha kulavira sadaka kuhumira mawe ambago tagayatsongbwa. Dzulu ya phatu hipho pha kulavira sadaka mundamlavira Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, sadaka za kuochwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lavyani sadaka za amani, mzirye phapho hipho na muhererwe mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha muandike maneno gosi ga shariya hino kpwenye mawe higo na maandishi gasomekago kpwa urahisi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha, Musa phamwenga na Alawi ambao ni alavyadzi-sadaka achiambira atu osi a Iziraeli, “Nyamalani mniphundze mwi atu a Iziraeli. Rero hino mwimwi mukakala atu a Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo phundzani sauti ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu na mlunge amurize na malagizoge ambago ninakuamuruni hivi rero.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
